          "docs": "Retrieve a paginated list of bills.\n\nSupports:\n- Pagination (`page_size`, `page`)\n- Date filtering (`updated_after`, `updated_before`)\n- Sorting (`order_by`)\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create Bill",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.coperniq.io/v1/bills",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "x-api-key",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a new bill.\n\nRequired fields:\n- `recordId`: Project ID (the project must exist first)\n- `calculationMethod`: Must be \"LINE_ITEMS\" or \"PERCENTAGE\"\n- `lineItems`: Array of at least one line item if calculationMethod is \"LINE_ITEMS\"\n- `percentage`: Percentage if calculationMethod is \"PERCENTAGE\"\n\n**Line item rules for bills:**\n- `unitCost` must be greater than 0 (strictly positive — bills represent vendor costs)\n- `unitPrice` may be negative (negative values represent discounts)\n\nOptional fi"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Bill",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.coperniq.io/v1/bills/:billId",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "x-api-key",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "billId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Bill identifier"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Retrieve a specific bill by ID"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Update Bill",
            "type": "http"
