            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "https://api.coperniq.io/v1/bills/:billId",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "x-api-key",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "billId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Bill identifier"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Update an existing bill. Supports partial updates.\n\nUpdatable fields:\n- `calculationMethod`: Must be \"LINE_ITEMS\" or \"PERCENTAGE\"\n- `lineItems`: Array of line items if calculationMethod is \"LINE_ITEMS\"\n- `percentage`: Percentage if calculationMethod is \"PERCENTAGE\"\n- `dueDate`: ISO 8601 datetime string\n- `issueDate`: ISO 8601 datetime string\n- `description`: Bill description\n- `status`: Bill status\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Delete Bill",
            "type": "http"
